      "writtenOn": "2024-07-03T03:22:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The issue you mentioned does exist, thanks for pointing it out. We\u0027ve revised our approach by sending messages to `mHandler` only when there are no existing messages of the same type. While rate limiting within `handleMessage` could be an option, it would require additional data structures and would also result in storing redundant messages in the message queue, in both proposed solutions (`tokenBucket` and maintaining `lastTime`). This might not be a better solution than our current approach. Please reopen if there are any further issues.",
